%% Flooded Bunker (T1, behind the marsh blast door; the story bunker). Theme: abandoned shelter. Locks: BADGE (duty locker), POWER (generator, fuse from the armory). The command level is half under water. Loop: the hatch ladder up from the command level back to the decon lock.
%% start: Bd
%% goal: Cs
flowchart TD
  Bd["Blast Door {start}"] --> Dl["Decontamination Lock: the hub; a badge door and the dead armory door in sight"]
  Dl --> Ba["Barracks {item:badge}: the duty locker"]
  Ba --> Ms["Mess"]
  Dl -->|req:badge| Ar["Armory {item:fuse}"]
  Ar --> Gn["Generator Room"]
  Gn -->|req:fuse| Sw["Generator switch {item:power}"]
  Ba -->|req:power| Cm["Command Level: half under water"]
  Cm --> Cs["Command Safe {goal}"]
  Cm --> Hl["Hatch Ladder: up to the surface"]
  Hl -->|shortcut| Dl
